# 📦 LCA Complete Module Migration Package & Integration Guide

A standalone **LCA** package directory has been created at `LCA/` in the project root. This directory contains all frontend components, backend logic, services, migrations, and database data fixtures required to move and merge LCA functionality to another branch or system.

---

