## 🛠️ Data Dump Included

The package includes **293 database objects** exported directly from the active database:
- `LcaRevision` (20 revisions)
- `CoTargetRevision` (5 revisions)
- `CdapRevision` (267 revisions)
- `CdapActiveLearningAnalysisMapping` (1 master mapping)

---

## 🚀 Step-by-Step Instructions to Merge on Target Branch/System

### Step 1: Copy Frontend Files
Copy the frontend files from `LCA/frontend/` into your target repository:
- `LCA/frontend/pages/lca/` ➡️ `frontend/src/pages/lca/`
- `LCA/frontend/services/lcaDb.ts` ➡️ `frontend/src/services/lcaDb.ts`

In `frontend/src/App.tsx`, register the LCA routes:
```tsx
import LCAPage from './pages/lca/LCAPage';
import COTargetPage from './pages/lca/COTargetPage';
import CDAPPage from './pages/lca/CDAPPage';
import ArticulationMatrixPage from './pages/lca/ArticulationMatrixPage';
import LCAInstructionsPage from './pages/lca/LCAInstructionsPage';

<Route path="/obe/course/:code/lca" element={<LCAPage />} />
<Route path="/obe/course/:code/lca/pbr" element={<LCAPage />} />
<Route path="/obe/course/:code/lca/cotarget" element={<COTargetPage />} />
<Route path="/obe/course/:code/cdap" element={<CDAPPage />} />
<Route path="/obe/course/:code/articulation" element={<ArticulationMatrixPage />} />
<Route path="/obe/course/:code/lca/instructions" element={<LCAInstructionsPage />} />
```

### Step 2: Integrate Backend
- Merge models from `LCA/backend/models_lca.py` into your backend app (`backend/OBE/models.py`).
- Copy parser services from `LCA/backend/services/*` into `backend/OBE/services/`.
- Merge views from `LCA/backend/views_lca.py` into `backend/OBE/views.py`.
- Add URL routes from `LCA/backend/urls_lca.py` to `backend/OBE/urls.py`.

Run migrations:
```bash
cd backend
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
```

### Step 3: Import the Data Fixture
Run the automated data loader:
```bash
python LCA/load_lca_data.py
```
*Or run Django loaddata:*
```bash
python manage.py loaddata LCA/data/lca_fixture.json
```

---

## 🤖 Prompt to Provide to AI on the Target System/Branch

When you move this `LCA` folder to your target branch or computer, copy and paste this prompt to the AI on that system:

> "Please merge the LCA module contained in the `LCA/` folder into this codebase:
> 1. Copy `LCA/frontend/pages/lca` and `LCA/frontend/services/lcaDb.ts` to `frontend/src/`.
> 2. Register the LCA routes in `frontend/src/App.tsx`.
> 3. Merge backend models from `LCA/backend/models_lca.py` into `backend/OBE/models.py`, copy services from `LCA/backend/services/` to `backend/OBE/services/`, and register API views & URLs.
> 4. Run `python manage.py migrate`.
> 5. Run `python LCA/load_lca_data.py` to migrate the 293 LCA/CDAP data records into the database."
